  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2411.02513v4</id>
    <title>A short proof of the Hilton-Milner Theorem</title>
    <updated>2025-11-19T14:07:38Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.02513v4" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2411.02513v4" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We give a short and relatively elementary proof of the Hilton-Milner Theorem.</summary>
    <category term="math.CO" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
    <published>2024-11-04T19:00:19Z</published>
    <arxiv:comment>5 pages; v2 adds ref to preprint arXiv:2411.03674 (arXived 2 days after the our initial preprint) and has other minor fixes; v3 adds easy proof of uniqueness; v4 has minor changes for publication</arxiv:comment>
